stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Absent
  Absent --> Active: Enable this installation
  Active --> Active: Refresh unchanged subscription
  Active --> Active: Replace endpoint or keys with a new generation
  Active --> Revoked: Disable this installation
  Active --> Expired: Browser subscription expires
  Revoked --> Active: Register again with a fresh action
  Expired --> Active: Register a fresh subscription
  Revoked --> Revoked: Disable again
  Absent --> Absent: Disable unknown installation
  Expired --> Revoked: Disable expired installation
  %% never Active with another actor's subscription
  %% never Active above three installations
